# Private local tooling. Placed after the "!docs/**" re-include above, because a
# later rule wins: docs/deepseek api.py carries an API key fallback and must
# never be published. Keep the key in the DEEPSEEK_API_KEY environment variable.
docs/deepseek api.py

# The website's robots.txt is a published file, so it must escape the blanket
# "*.txt" rule above. A later rule wins, which is also why this sits at the end.
!10_Personal_Website/robots.txt
